{"id":"135511","t":{"th":"ทะลุมิติตะลุยวังหลวง","ro":"Cheng He Titong","en":"How Dare You!?","na":"成何体统"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx135511-n6sWcujLLfdM.png","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx135511-n6sWcujLLfdM.png","color":"#e4785d","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/135511-omtMPiIjPVJP.jpg","fmt":"ONA","status":"FINISHED","eps":24,"dur":26,"season":null,"year":null,"start":"2024-06-14","country":"CN","genres":["Comedy","Romance"],"score":74,"pop":2458,"studio":"Shengying Animation","desc":"Because of her long commute from home to work, Wang Cuihua spends her time reading web novels. She reads so many of them that after two years, she is able to guess where the plot is going to lead just by reading the first lines.\n\nOne day, she starts a new work where the heroine transmigrates in a novel but it quickly bores her. However, while trying to leave the page, she finds herself sucked into her cell phone. She then wakes up in the novel as the concubine Yu Wanyin, one of the antagonists of the story.\n\nIn order to survive, Yu Wanyin plans to join forces with Xia Houdan to assassinate Emperor Duan Wang, and then to kill Xia Houdan in turn in order to become empress herself.\n\nHowever, her plan quickly falls apart when she discovers that the current Xia Houdan is also not from this world!","descTh":"เนื่องจากเธอต้องเดินทางไกลจากบ้านไปที่ทำงาน Wang Cuihua จึงใช้เวลาอ่านนิยายบนเว็บ เธออ่านหลายเล่มจนผ่านไปสองปี เธอสามารถเดาได้ว่าโครงเรื่องจะนำไปสู่จุดใดเพียงแค่อ่านบรรทัดแรก\n\nวันหนึ่งเธอเริ่มงานใหม่ที่นางเอกแปลงร่างมาในนิยายแต่กลับทำให้เธอเบื่อหน่ายอย่างรวดเร็ว อย่างไรก็ตาม ขณะที่พยายามจะออกจากเพจ เธอพบว่าตัวเองถูกดูดเข้าไปในโทรศัพท์มือถือของเธอ จากนั้นเธอก็ตื่นขึ้นมาในนวนิยายเรื่องนี้ในฐานะนางสนม Yu Wanyin ซึ่งเป็นหนึ่งในศัตรูของเรื่อง\n\nเพื่อความอยู่รอด Yu Wanyin วางแผนที่จะร่วมมือกับ Xia Houdan เพื่อลอบสังหารจักรพรรดิ Duan Wang จากนั้นจึงสังหาร Xia Houdan ตามลำดับเพื่อที่จะได้เป็นจักรพรรดินีเอง\n\nอย่างไรก็ตาม แผนการของเธอก็พังทลายลงอย่างรวดเร็วเมื่อเธอค้นพบว่า Xia Houdan ในปัจจุบันไม่ได้มาจากโลกนี้เช่นกัน!","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"HEQDwdCjmC0","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/135511","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/59001","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"iqiyi","r":"TH","u":"https://www.iq.com/album/%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%87-2024-1revts5tlil?lang=th_th","lang":"sub","eps":[["19","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%87-ep-19-244pcrcz8wg?lang=th_th",1793898000,"d","q:7/20260626/3d/c5/v_202666625_m_601_th_m1",null,{"d":1509,"a":"vip","alt":[["https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%87-ep-19-1tamyqf6mwk?lang=th_th",1726678800,"d"]]}],["18","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%87-ep-18-kqhf33942c?lang=th_th",1793293200,"d","q:2/20260626/54/4e/v_202666622_m_601_th_m1",null,{"d":1542,"a":"vip","alt":[["https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%87-ep-18-begwh37ga8?lang=th_th",1726074000,"d"]]}],["17","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%B0%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%87%E0%